# Vercel CLI upload filter.
#
# The Git-integration path only ever sees the repository, but `vercel --prod`
# run from this folder uploads the working tree. These are the local-only
# artifacts that must never travel: dependencies and build output are rebuilt
# on Vercel anyway, and the caches/logs are machine-local scratch.
node_modules
.next
.vercel
.env*
*-server.log
*.tsbuildinfo
scripts/.harvest-cache.json
scripts/.fa-cache.json
__pycache__
.DS_Store
